<title>JAPAN: TSE says to delist Tada on October 31.</title>
<headline>TSE says to delist Tada on October 31.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tokyo Stock Exchange said on Wednesday that it would delist construction company Tada Corp on October 31.  </p>
<p>Tada said earlier on Wednesday that it had applied for court protection under Japanese bankruptcy laws.</p>
<p>Tada said it has debts totalling 171.4 billion yen.</p>
</text>
